title: Vautrin_Talk_Stay
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳, 留守原因
---
<<if $rel_vautrin >= 30>>

魏特琳: {站在窗边，看着安全区} "Mr. Chen, do you know why I stayed?"

陈默: {用英语} "Why, Miss Vautrin?"

魏特琳: {转身，微笑} "Many people asked me to leave... The embassy, my colleagues, even my family..."

魏特琳: "They said it's too dangerous... A woman alone in a war zone..."

魏特琳: {坚定} "But how could I leave? How could I abandon these people?"

魏特琳: "I've been in China for 28 years... I've taught thousands of Chinese girls..."

魏特琳: {温柔} "They call me '华小姐'... They trust me... They need me..."

陈默: "您是个伟大的人。"

魏特琳: {摇头} "No, not great... Just doing what I should do."

魏特琳: "When I came to China in 1912, I made a promise to God..."

魏特琳: "I promised to serve the Chinese people, to help them, especially women and children..."

魏特琳: {看着远处} "Now they need me the most... How can I break my promise?"

-> [敬佩]"The world needs more people like you."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 10>>
    魏特琳: {微笑} "Thank you, but I'm just one person doing one thing."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Stay_Continue>>

-> [担心]"But you also need to protect yourself."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 8>>
    <<set $concern_shown = true>>
    魏特琳: {感动} "I appreciate your concern, but I'll be fine."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Stay_Continue>>

<<else>>
魏特琳: "Good day, Mr. Chen."
陈默: "Good day, Miss Vautrin."
[关系不足，无法深入交谈]
===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Stay_Continue
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳
---
魏特琳: "You know what keeps me going?"

魏特琳: {指着窗外} "Look at those women and children..."

魏特琳: "Every day, more people come to the Safety Zone..."

魏特琳: "They're scared, hungry, desperate... But when they see this place..."

魏特琳: {眼中有光} "They see hope... They know they're safe here..."

魏特琳: "That's why I stay... To be that hope for them..."

陈默: {感动} "您已经拯救了很多人。"

魏特琳: "Not enough... Never enough... There are so many more outside..."

魏特琳: {疲惫} "Sometimes I wish I could do more... Be in more places..."

<<set $vautrin_mission_understood = true>>
<<set $rel_vautrin += 10>>

===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Faith
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳, 信仰
---
<<if $rel_vautrin >= 50>>

[场景：夜晚，魏特琳在小礼拜堂祈祷]

陈默: {轻声} "Miss Vautrin... Sorry to disturb you..."

魏特琳: {睁开眼睛，微笑} "It's alright, Mr. Chen. Please, come in."

陈默: {坐下} "You pray every night?"

魏特琳: "Yes... It's my source of strength..."

魏特琳: {双手合十} "When I see so much suffering... So much evil..."

魏特琳: "I need to remember that God is still there... That there's still good in this world..."

陈默: "Do you ever doubt?"

魏特琳: {沉默片刻} "...Yes. Often."

魏特琳: "When I see a mother holding her dead child..."

魏特琳: "When I see girls who've been violated..."

魏特琳: "When I see such cruelty... Such inhumanity..."

魏特琳: {声音颤抖} "I ask God... Why? Why allow this?"

陈默: "What's your answer?"

魏特琳: "I don't have answers... Only faith..."

魏特琳: "Faith that even in darkness, there's light..."

魏特琳: "Faith that what we do matters..."

魏特琳: {坚定} "Faith that love is stronger than hate..."

-> [共鸣]"Your faith is inspiring."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 12>>
    魏特琳: "Thank you... Sometimes I need to hear that..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Faith_Continue>>

-> [质疑]"But how can you maintain faith seeing all this?"
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 10>>
    <<set $deep_conversation = true>>
    魏特琳: {苦笑} "That's the hardest question..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Faith_Deep>>

<<else>>
[关系不足，无法进行此对话]
===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Faith_Continue
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳
---
魏特琳: "You know what I pray for?"

魏特琳: "I pray for strength... Not just for me, but for everyone here..."

魏特琳: "I pray for those soldiers who've lost their way..."

魏特琳: "I pray for the victims... That they can find peace..."

魏特琳: {看着陈默} "And I pray for people like you..."

魏特琳: "Those who choose to help even when it's dangerous..."

陈默: "我只是做我能做的……"

魏特琳: "That's all any of us can do... But it's everything..."

<<set $vautrin_faith_shared = true>>
<<set $rel_vautrin += 10>>

===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Faith_Deep
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳, 深层信仰
---
魏特琳: {深吸一口气} "Honestly, Mr. Chen... Sometimes I feel my faith breaking..."

魏特琳: "When I can't save someone... When I have to turn people away because there's no room..."

魏特琳: "When I hear the screams at night... And I can do nothing..."

魏特琳: {眼泪滑落} "I feel so... powerless..."

陈默: {递上手帕}

魏特琳: {接过，擦泪} "Thank you..."

魏特琳: "But then I remember... Even if I save just one person..."

魏特琳: "To that person, I've changed everything..."

魏特琳: "And that... That's worth it..."

<<set $vautrin_vulnerability_shown = true>>
<<set $rel_vautrin += 15>>

===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Refugees
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳, 难民故事
---
<<if $rel_vautrin >= 40>>

魏特琳: {翻着笔记本} "Mr. Chen, let me tell you some stories..."

魏特琳: "Yesterday, a woman came with three children..."

魏特琳: "Her husband was taken by soldiers... She doesn't know if he's alive..."

魏特琳: "She walked for three days to get here... Her feet were bleeding..."

魏特琳: {翻页} "There's a girl, only 14... She was hiding in a pond for two days..."

魏特琳: "When we found her, she was nearly frozen... But alive..."

魏特琳: "She won't talk... She just stares... But at least she's safe now..."

魏特琳: {继续翻} "An old man brought his granddaughter..."

魏特琳: "His whole family died... Only this little girl survived..."

魏特琳: "He begged us to take her... He said he was too old, too weak..."

魏特琳: "He just wanted her to live..."

陈默: {沉重} "So many tragedies..."

魏特琳: "Yes... And these are just three stories... I have hundreds..."

魏特琳: {合上笔记本} "I write them all down... Every single one..."

魏特琳: "Someone needs to remember... Someone needs to tell the world..."

魏特琳: {坚定} "This cannot be forgotten... This cannot happen again..."

陈默: {内心} 可是历史会重复……在其他地方……其他时代……

-> [支持]"I'll help you document everything."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 12>>
    <<set $documentation_helper = true>>
    魏特琳: {感激} "Thank you... That means a lot..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Refugees_End>>

-> [承诺]"Their stories will be remembered. I promise."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 10>>
    <<set $memory_promise = true>>
    魏特琳: "I believe you... Thank you..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Refugees_End>>

<<else>>
[关系不足，无法进行此对话]
===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Refugees_End
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳
---
魏特琳: "Every person here has a story..."

魏特琳: "They're not just numbers... Not just refugees..."

魏特琳: "They're mothers, daughters, sisters... Each with hopes, dreams, fears..."

魏特琳: {看着陈默} "We must never forget that..."

魏特琳: "No matter how many people there are... Each life matters..."

<<set $refugee_stories_heard = true>>
<<set $rel_vautrin += 10>>

===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Humanity
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳, 人性反思
---
<<if $rel_vautrin >= 60 and $vautrin_faith_shared == true>>

[场景：深夜，办公室，魏特琳疲惫不堪]

魏特琳: {看着陈默} "Mr. Chen... Can I ask you something?"

陈默: "Of course."

魏特琳: "Do you believe humans are fundamentally good or evil?"

陈默: {思考} "Why do you ask?"

魏特琳: "I used to believe people are inherently good..."

魏特琳: "That evil comes from ignorance, poverty, desperation..."

魏特琳: {痛苦} "But what I've seen here... The cruelty, the violence..."

魏特琳: "Some of those soldiers... They enjoy it..."

魏特琳: "They smile while hurting people... They laugh..."

魏特琳: {颤抖} "How can that be ignorance? That's... That's pure evil..."

陈默: "But you're still here, helping people. That's goodness."

魏特琳: "Yes, but... For every one of me, there are hundreds of them..."

魏特琳: "Am I fighting a losing battle? Is goodness just... Overwhelmed by evil?"

-> [乐观]"No. One light in darkness is enough."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 15>>
    <<set $hope_restored = true>>
    魏特琳: {眼中重现光芒} "You're right... Thank you..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Humanity_Continue>>

-> [现实]"I don't know. But we must try anyway."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 12>>
    魏特琳: {点头} "Yes... We must try..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Humanity_Continue>>

<<else>>
[关系不足，无法进行此对话]
===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Humanity_Continue
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳
---
魏特琳: "I've been thinking about this a lot..."

魏特琳: "Maybe humans are both... Capable of great good and great evil..."

魏特琳: "The question is... Which side do we choose to nurture?"

魏特琳: {站起来，看向窗外} "These women and children here..."

魏特琳: "They've seen the worst of humanity..."

魏特琳: "But they've also seen kindness... Sacrifice... Love..."

魏特琳: "People sharing their last piece of bread..."

魏特琳: "Strangers protecting each other..."

魏特琳: "Mothers dying to save their children..."

魏特琳: {转身} "That's humanity too... Maybe that's the real humanity..."

陈默: "您让我看到了人性最美好的一面。"

魏特琳: {微笑} "And you help me remember why I do this..."

<<set $humanity_discussion = true>>
<<set $rel_vautrin += 15>>

===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Exhaustion
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳, 疲惫
---
<<if $rel_vautrin >= 70>>

[场景：魏特琳靠在椅子上，罕见地显露疲态]

陈默: {担心} "Miss Vautrin, you need to rest."

魏特琳: {苦笑} "Rest? How can I rest?"

魏特琳: "There are 10,000 people here depending on me..."

魏特琳: "Every day, more come... Every day, more problems..."

魏特琳: "Food shortages, disease outbreaks, conflicts..."

魏特琳: {揉着太阳穴} "And the Japanese soldiers... They come every day..."

魏特琳: "Demanding to search for soldiers... Demanding to take women..."

魏特琳: "I have to stand at the gate... Argue with them... Threaten them..."

魏特琳: {颤抖} "I'm so tired, Mr. Chen... So, so tired..."

陈默: "Let me help you. You can't do everything alone."

魏特琳: {摇头} "You're already helping... Everyone is helping..."

魏特琳: "But it's not enough... It's never enough..."

魏特琳: {眼泪滑落} "Last night, I dreamed I was drowning..."

魏特琳: "Drowning in a sea of people... All reaching for me... Calling my name..."

魏特琳: "And I couldn't save them all... I couldn't..."

-> [安慰]{抱住她} "You're doing more than anyone could ask."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 20>>
    <<set $emotional_support = true>>
    魏特琳: {靠在陈默肩上，哭泣} "Thank you... Thank you..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Exhaustion_End>>

-> [现实]"You need to take care of yourself too."
    <<set $rel_vautrin += 15>>
    魏特琳: {擦泪} "I know... I'll try..."
    <<jump Vautrin_Talk_Exhaustion_End>>

<<else>>
[关系不足，无法进行此对话]
===

title: Vautrin_Talk_Exhaustion_End
tags: 深度对话, 魏特琳
---
魏特琳: {渐渐平静} "I'm sorry... I shouldn't break down like this..."

陈默: "You're human. You're allowed to feel."

魏特琳: "But they need me to be strong..."

陈默: "Being strong doesn't mean never breaking. It means getting back up."

魏特琳: {看着陈默，微笑} "You're wise, Mr. Chen... Thank you..."

魏特琳: {深吸一口气} "Alright... I'll rest for an hour... Then back to work..."

陈默（内心）: {痛苦} 她不知道……她最终会崩溃……会在1941年……

陈默（内心）: 我该告诉她吗……还是让她继续燃烧自己……

<<set $vautrin_exhaustion_witnessed = true>>
<<set $rel_vautrin = 95>>

===
